OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies raping girl on Great
OL,4,AYarmouth beach
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 35-year-old man has pleaded not
OL,7,Fguilty to the rape and sexual assault
OL,8,Fof a girl and to the sexual assault of
OL,9,Fa second girl on the beach at Great
OL,10,FYarmouth.
OL,12,FNorfolk Police has been investigating
OL,13,Freports that two teenage girls were
OL,14,Fraped on South Beach Parade in the
OL,15,Fearly hours of 16 May.
OL,17,FDawid Wlach appeared before King's Lynn
OL,18,FCrown Court on Wednesday, where he
OL,19,Fdenied the four charges he faces.
OL,21,FWlach, of Dover Court, Caister-on-Sea,
OL,22,Fis due to stand trial later this year.
